{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #143", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Area of base of cone is 64&#960; cm<sup>2</sup> and length of slant height of the cone is 14 cm. Find the lateral surface area of the cone.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; 64&#960; cm<sup>2 </sup>&#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; 14 cm &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["374 cm<sup>2</sup>", "275 cm<sup>2</sup>", "253 cm<sup>2</sup>", "352 cm<sup>2</sup>"], "options_hi": ["374 cm<sup>2</sup>", "275 cm<sup>2</sup>", "253 cm<sup>2</sup>", "352 cm<sup>2</sup>"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let radius of base of cone = 'r' cm</p><p>Area of base = &#960;r<sup>2</sup></p><p>64&#960; = &#960;r<sup>2</sup></p><p>r = 8 cm</p><p>Slant height = l = 14 cm</p><p>Lateral surface area of cone = &#960;rl</p><p>= (22/7) * 8 * 14</p><p>= 352 cm<sup>2</sup></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let radius of base of cone = 'r' cm</p><p>Area of base = &#960;r<sup>2</sup></p><p>64&#960; = &#960;r<sup>2</sup></p><p>r = 8 cm</p><p>Slant height = l = 14 cm</p><p>Lateral surface area of cone = &#960;rl</p><p>= (22/7) * 8 * 14</p><p>= 352 cm<sup>2</sup></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p> The volume of a solid right circular cone is 600&pi; cm <sup>3</sup> , and the diameter of its base is 30 cm. The total surface area (in cm <sup>2</sup> ) of the cone is: </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2336;&#2379;&#2360; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; 600&#960; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;<sup>3 </sup>&#2361;&#2376;, &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2360; 30 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2340;&#2379;, &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; (&#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;<sup>2 </sup>&#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["496&pi;", "480&pi;", "255&pi;", "472&pi;"], "options_hi": ["496&#960;", "480&#960;", "255&#960;", "472&#960;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "\"<p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/1d3efe864cf27ebd3041efbd0404a45b.png\" /> </p>\"", "solution_hi": "\"<p> <img src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/stubeimg/1d3efe864cf27ebd3041efbd0404a45b.png\" /> </p>\"", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The base radius of a cone and its slant height are in the ratio of 3: 7. If the lateral surface area of cone is 3234 cm<sup>2</sup>, then find the difference between its base radius and slant height.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 3:7 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2381;&#2357; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; 3234cm<sup>2</sup> &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["24 cm", "26 cm", "22 cm", "28 cm"], "options_hi": ["24 cm", "26 cm", "22 cm", "28 cm"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let the base radius of cone be 3x cm and its slant height be 7x cm.</p><p>Given,</p><p>Lateral surface area = 3234 cm<sup>2</sup></p><p>&#928; * r * l = 3234</p><p>(22/7) * 3x * 7x = 3234</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> = 3234 * 7/ (21 * 22)</p><p>x = &radic;49 = 7 cm</p><p>Required difference = 7x  -  3x = 4x = 4 * 7 = 28 cm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the base radius of cone be 3x cm and its slant height be 7x cm.</p><p>Given,</p><p>Lateral surface area = 3234 cm<sup>2</sup></p><p>&#928; * r * l = 3234</p><p>(22/7) * 3x * 7x = 3234</p><p>x<sup>2</sup> = 3234 * 7/ (21 * 22)</p><p>x = &radic;49 = 7 cm</p><p>Required difference = 7x  -  3x = 4x = 4 * 7 = 28 cm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the total surface area (in sq. cm) of a cone if the base radius of cone is 7/2 cm and slant height of the cone is 4 cm.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; 7/2 cm &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; 4 cm &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; (sq. cm &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["82.5", "76.5", "88.4", "105.2"], "options_hi": ["82.5", "76.5", "88.4", "105.2"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Total surface area = &#960; * r * (l + r)</p><p>= (22/7) * (7/2) * [4 + (7/2)]</p><p>= 11 * 15/2</p><p>= 82.5 cm<sup>2</sup></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Total surface area = &#960; * r * (l + r)</p><p>= (22/7) * (7/2) * [4 + (7/2)]</p><p>= 11 * 15/2</p><p>= 82.5 cm<sup>2</sup></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The length of a cylindrical wire is 200 m. If the volume of the wire is 3.08 m<sup>3</sup>, then find the radius of the wire.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2354;&#2350;&#2381;&#2348;&#2366;&#2312; 200 m &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; 3.08 m<sup>3 </sup>&#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2340;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["7 cm", "14 cm", "9 cm", "21 cm"], "options_hi": ["7 cm", "14 cm", "9 cm", "21 cm"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>h = 200m</p><p>Volume of the cylindrical wire = 3.08 m<sup>3</sup></p><p>&#928;r<sup>2</sup>h = 3.08 m<sup>3</sup></p><p><img width=23 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image004.png\"> * r<sup>2</sup> * 200 = 3.08</p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = <img width=63 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image005.png\"></p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = <img width=69 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image006.png\"></p><p>r = <img width=31 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image007.png\"> m</p><p>r = 7 cm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>h = 200m</p><p>Volume of the cylindrical wire = 3.08 m<sup>3</sup></p><p>&#928;r<sup>2</sup>h = 3.08 m<sup>3</sup></p><p><img width=23 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image004.png\"> * r<sup>2</sup> * 200 = 3.08</p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = <img width=63 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image005.png\"></p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = <img width=69 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image006.png\"></p><p>r = <img width=31 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21013/image007.png\"> m</p><p>r = 7 cm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A solid cube of side 11 cm is melted and casted into a solid cylinder of height 3.5 cm. Find the radius of cylinder.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>11 cm &#2349;&#2369;&#2332;&#2366; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2336;&#2379;&#2360; &#2328;&#2344; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2367;&#2328;&#2354;&#2366;&#2325;&#2352; 3.5 cm &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2336;&#2379;&#2360; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2338;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["11 cm", "10.5 cm", "14 cm", "5.5 cm"], "options_hi": ["11 cm", "10.5 cm", "14 cm", "5.5 cm"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Volume of cube = Volume of cylinder</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> = &#960;r<sup>2</sup>h</p><p>11<sup>3</sup> = (22/7) * r<sup>2</sup> * 3.5</p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = 121</p><p>r = 11 cm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Volume of cube = Volume of cylinder</p><p>a<sup>3</sup> = &#960;r<sup>2</sup>h</p><p>11<sup>3</sup> = (22/7) * r<sup>2</sup> * 3.5</p><p>r<sup>2</sup> = 121</p><p>r = 11 cm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The volume of a cylinder is 138600 cm<sup>2</sup> and its height is 25 cm, then find the radius of the base of the cylinder?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; 138600 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2327; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2306;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; 25 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;?</p>", "options_en": ["28 cm", "44 cm", "42 cm", "35 cm"], "options_hi": ["28 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;", "44 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;", "42 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;", "35 &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>The volume of a cylinder is 138600 cm<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; 22/7 * r<sup>2</sup> * 25 = 138600</p><p>=&gt; r<sup>2</sup> = 1764</p><p>=&gt; r = 42 cm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The volume of a cylinder is 138600 cm<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; 22/7 * r<sup>2</sup> * 25 = 138600</p><p>=&gt; r<sup>2</sup> = 1764</p><p>=&gt; r = 42 cm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A largest possible cone is cut out from a cube of volume 1331 cm<sup>3</sup>. The volume of the cone is :</p>", "q_hi": "<p>1331 &#2328;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368; &#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375; &#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2306;&#2349;&#2357; &#2360;&#2348;&#2360;&#2375; &#2348;&#2337;&#2364;&#2366; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366;&#2335;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["380 cu cm", "348.6 cu cm", "369.1 cu cm", "396.1 cu cm"], "options_hi": ["380 &#2328;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;", "348.6 &#2328;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;", "36 9 .1 &#2328;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;", "3 9 6.1 &#2328;&#2344; &#2360;&#2375;&#2350;&#2368;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Volume = 1331 cm<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup>, therefore each edge a = 11 cm</p><p>The radius of the base of the cone = 11/2 = 5.5</p><p>Height of cone=11</p><p>Volume = (1/3) x (22/7) x (5.5) x (5.5) x (11) = 348.6 cu cm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Volume = 1331 cm<sup>3</sup> = a<sup>3</sup>, therefore each edge a = 11 cm</p><p>The radius of the base of the cone = 11/2 = 5.5</p><p>Height of cone=11</p><p>Volume = (1/3) x (22/7) x (5.5) x (5.5) x (11) = 348.6 cu cm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the total surface area (in sq. cm) of a cylinder whose base radius and height are 4.8 cm and 10.2 cm respectively.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2346;&#2371;&#2359;&#2381;&#2336;&#2368;&#2351; &#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2375;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2347;&#2354; (sq. cm &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;, &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 4.8 cm &#2324;&#2352; 10.2 cm &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["192&#960;", "144&#960;", "168&#960;", "154&#960;"], "options_hi": ["192&#960;", "144&#960;", "168&#960;", "154&#960;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Base radius = 4.8 cm</p><p>Height = 10.2 cm</p><p>Total surface area = 2&#960;r (r + h)</p><p>= 2 * &#960; * 4.8 * (4.8 + 10.2)</p><p>= 9.6 * &#960; * 15</p><p>= 4.8 * &#960; * 30</p><p>= 144&#960;</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Base radius = 4.8 cm</p><p>Height = 10.2 cm</p><p>Total surface area = 2&#960;r (r + h)</p><p>= 2 * &#960; * 4.8 * (4.8 + 10.2)</p><p>= 9.6 * &#960; * 15</p><p>= 4.8 * &#960; * 30</p><p>= 144&#960;</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The shape of storage tank is cylinder, and its height and radius are 18 cm and 7/2 cm, respectively. Determine how much liquid the tank can contain. (Take &#960; = 22/7)</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2360;&#2381;&#2335;&#2379;&#2352;&#2375;&#2332; &#2335;&#2376;&#2306;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2324;&#2352; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 18 cm &#2324;&#2352; 7/2 cm &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2361; &#2344;&#2367;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2325;&#2367; &#2335;&#2376;&#2306;&#2325; &#2340;&#2352;&#2354; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366; &#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; (&#960; = 22/7 &#2354;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;)</p>", "options_en": ["582 cubic cm", "715 cubic cm", "693 cubic cm", "621 cubic cm"], "options_hi": ["582 &#2328;&#2344; cm", "715 &#2328;&#2344; cm", "693 &#2328;&#2344; cm", "621 &#2328;&#2344; cm"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Quantity of liquid = &#960; * r * r * h</p><p>= (22/7) * (7/2) * (7/2) * 18</p><p>= 11 * 63</p><p>= 693 cubic cm</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Quantity of liquid = &#960; * r * r * h</p><p>= (22/7) * (7/2) * (7/2) * 18</p><p>= 11 * 63</p><p>= 693 cubic cm</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The base radius of a circular cone and its height are in the ratio of 13: 7. If the sum of its radius and height is 40 cm, then find the volume (in cm<sup>3</sup>) of the cone.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2371;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2366;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2346;&#2366;&#2340; 13:7 &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2368; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2324;&#2352; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2325;&#2366; &#2351;&#2379;&#2327;&#2347;&#2354; 40 cm &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; (cm<sup>3 </sup>&#2350;&#2375;&#2306;) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["9914.66", "9472.22", "9592.33", "9884.66"], "options_hi": ["9914.66", "9472.22", "9592.33", "9884.66"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let the radius and height of cone be 13X and 7X respectively.</p><p>Given,</p><p>13X + 7X = 40</p><p>20X = 40</p><p>X = 2</p><p>So, radius = 13X = 13*2 = 26 cm and</p><p>Height = 7X = 7*2 = 14 cm</p><p>Volume of cone = (1/3) * &#960; * 26 * 26 * 14</p><p>= (1/3) * (22/7) * 676 * 14</p><p>= 9914.66 cm<sup>3</sup></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the radius and height of cone be 13X and 7X respectively.</p><p>Given,</p><p>13X + 7X = 40</p><p>20X = 40</p><p>X = 2</p><p>So, radius = 13X = 13*2 = 26 cm and</p><p>Height = 7X = 7*2 = 14 cm</p><p>Volume of cone = (1/3) * &#960; * 26 * 26 * 14</p><p>= (1/3) * (22/7) * 676 * 14</p><p>= 9914.66 cm<sup>3</sup></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A reservoir is in the shape of a cylinder. Water is pouring into it at the rate of 80 L per minute. The volume of the reservoir is 200 cubic m. How many hours will it take to fill the reservoir?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2332;&#2354;&#2366;&#2358;&#2351; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2310;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2325;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; 80 &#2354;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2350;&#2367;&#2344;&#2335; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2346;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2327;&#2367;&#2352; &#2352;&#2361;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2332;&#2354;&#2366;&#2358;&#2351; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2351;&#2340;&#2344; 200 &#2328;&#2344; &#2350;&#2368;&#2335;&#2352; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2332;&#2354;&#2366;&#2358;&#2351; &#2325;&#2379; &#2349;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2375; &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375; &#2354;&#2327;&#2375;&#2306;&#2327;&#2375;?</p>", "options_en": ["45 hours", "30.32 hours", "41.66 hours", "35 hours"], "options_hi": ["45 &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375;", "30.32 &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375;", "41.66 &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375;", "35 &#2328;&#2306;&#2335;&#2375;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Volume of reservoir = 200 cubic m = 200 * 1000 L</p><p>Required time = 200 * 1000/ (80 * 60) hours</p><p>= 41.66 hours</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Volume of reservoir = 200 cubic m = 200 * 1000 L</p><p>Required time = 200 * 1000/ (80 * 60) hours</p><p>= 41.66 hours</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A cone is melted and recasted into a cylinder such that base radius of a cone is 4/7<sup>th</sup> of base radius of cylinder. Find the height of cone if the height of cylinder is 48 cm.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2379; &#2346;&#2367;&#2328;&#2354;&#2366;&#2325;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2338;&#2366;&#2354;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2325;&#2367; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;, &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2310;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2332;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; 4/7 &#2349;&#2366;&#2327; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2375;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; 48 cm &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["441 cm", "484 cm", "421 cm", "432 cm"], "options_hi": ["441 cm", "484 cm", "421 cm", "432 cm"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let base radius of cone be r cm and base radius of cylinder be R cm.</p><p>Therefore, given r = 4R/7</p><p>Volume of the cone = Volume of the cylinder</p><p><img width=92 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=139 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image006.png\"></p><p><img width=65 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image007.png\"></p><p><img width=73 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image008.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let base radius of cone be r cm and base radius of cylinder be R cm.</p><p>Therefore, given r = 4R/7</p><p>Volume of the cone = Volume of the cylinder</p><p><img width=92 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image005.png\"></p><p><img width=139 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image006.png\"></p><p><img width=65 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image007.png\"></p><p><img width=73 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23862/image008.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A right circular cone is 6.4 cm high with a radius of its base of 5 cm. It is melted and recast into a right circular cone with the radius of its base 4 cm. Find its height.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2354;&#2306;&#2348; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2340;&#2381;&#2340;&#2369;&#2354; &#2358;&#2306;&#2325;&#2369; &#2325;&#2368; &#2314;&#2305;&#2330;&#2366;&#2312; 6.4 cm &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2311;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#231